<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Sundrug rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sundrug rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd has assigned Sundrug Co Ltd a &quot;A&quot; rating, Daiwa</p>
<p>Securities brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute</p>
<p>assigns an &quot;A&quot; rating to issues whose values it</p>
<p>sees outperforming the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section</p>
<p>TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the next</p>
<p>six months.</p>
</text>
